,"canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s37010","name":"明石 賢人","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:199490","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"うさぎいンく","creatorId":"vndb:s38017","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s38017","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s38017","name":"うさぎいンく","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:199491","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c131033","characterName":"咲葉 百合","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"147789","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"452764"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26587"],"vndbCharacterId":"c131033"},"originalCharacterName":"咲葉 百合","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"98"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"168"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"61"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The mother of the Sakiba family. She is the biological mother of Sakura and Kaede, but her husband does not exist at this time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The mainstay of the cheerful and playful Sakiba family who loves to have fun."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Contrary to Yuri's caressing appearance, her skills in general housework are devastating and she leaves everything to her daughters. Sometimes doing housework causes catastrophe."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She loves her daughters and the main protagonist with all her heart, and wants to engage in skinship all the time. There is also a section in which she happily supports the relationship between her daughters and son."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In fact, she is the queen of succubi who rules the demon world, and her two daughters also have her blood. Like a queen of succubi, she is sexually unbridled and has the strongest sexual skills."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After her daughters awaken to become succubi, she trains the protagonist while helping the two."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c131033"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"咲葉家の母。桜と楓の実母であるが、今現在旦那は存在していない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愉しいことが大好きな、陽気で茶目っ気のある咲葉家の大黒柱。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大和撫子な見た目とは裏腹に、家事全般の腕は壊滅的で娘たちに全て任せっきり。たまに家事をやっては、大惨事を引き起こす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供たちの事を心から愛しており、ことあるごとにスキンシップをとりたがる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また娘と息子の関係性を、楽しげに応援している節もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は魔界を治めるサキュバスの女王であり、娘二人にもその血が流れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"サキュバスの女王らしく性に奔放で、性的技術も最強。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"娘がサキュバスに覚醒した後は、二人を助けつつも、主人公を特訓（味見）する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26587","sourceWorkId":"35033","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"咲葉家の母。桜と楓の実母であるが、今現在旦那は存在していない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愉しいことが大好きな、陽気で茶目っ気のある咲葉家の大黒柱。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大和撫子な見た目とは裏腹に、家事全般の腕は壊滅的で娘たちに全て任せっきり。たまに家事をやっては、大惨事を引き起こす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"娘や主人公たちの事を心から愛しており、ことあるごとにスキンシップをとりたがる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また娘と息子の関係性を、楽しげに応援している節もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は魔界を治めるサキュバスの女王であり、娘二人にもその血が流れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"サキュバスの女王らしく性に奔放で、性的技術も最強。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"娘がサキュバスに覚醒した後は、二人を助けつつも、主人公を特訓（味見）する。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"147789"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8cc5294aa3b6acbe52915d92cc4c535c15bd3da21567a2fbc78f5765ad473d12.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f059613b683266882435e1274da47e09e2d4cf1885c5c69288d0b8b5bdb3890d.webp","width":256,"height":252,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"雨宮侑布","creatorId":"vndb:s1450","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1450","canonicalEntityId"